<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Bankers Trust started buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Bankers Trust started buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Credit Suisse First Boston said analyst Brad Ball started coverage of Bankers Trust New York Corp on Thursday with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Bankers Trust said it would tie up with heavily indebted Nippon Credit Bank Ltd to help turn some of the Japanese bank's loans into cash.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed on Wednesday at 77-3/4 on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Ball was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
